+  📊 Total import issues: 38 → 2 (fixed: 36)
+
+🔧 IMPROVEMENTS APPLIED:
+  • ✅ Converted relative imports to absolute haive.* namespace
+  • ✅ Removed bad namespace patterns (src.haive, packages.haive)
+  • ✅ Added missing imports automatically
+  • ✅ Organized imports into proper sections (stdlib, 3rd party, haive)
+  • ✅ Removed unused import statements
