+## 🚀 **Quick Start**
+
+### 🔍 **1. Always Preview First**
+```bash
+# Preview the complete systematic fix plan
+poetry run task fix-code-preview
+
+# Preview individual components
+poetry run task fix-syntax-preview
+poetry run task fix-indentation-preview  
+poetry run task fix-imports-preview
+```
+
+### ⚡ **2. Quick Fixes (Most Common)**
+```bash
+# Fix obvious typos and basic formatting
+poetry run task quick-fix
+
+# Full systematic code fixing (all 4 steps)
+poetry run task full-fix
+
+# Check if everything compiles
+poetry run task health-check
+```
+
+### 🎯 **3. Step-by-Step (Recommended)**
+```bash
+# Step 1: Fix critical syntax errors
+poetry run task fix-code-step1
+
+# Step 2: Fix indentation and formatting  
+poetry run task fix-code-step2
+
+# Step 3: Manage imports (absolute, sorting, unused)
+poetry run task fix-code-step3
+
+# Step 4: Modernize Python syntax
+poetry run task fix-code-step4
