+## 🏗️ **Architecture Overview**
+
+### 📦 **Core Scripts**
+| Script | Purpose | Safety | Taskipy Alias |
+|--------|---------|--------|---------------|
+| `systematic-code-fixer.sh` | **Master orchestrator** - coordinates all fixes | ✅ Git stash + verification | `fix-code` |
+| `pre-flight-syntax-fixer.sh` | **Syntax typos** - fixes obvious errors | ✅ Backup + rollback | `fix-syntax` |
+| `modern-indentation-fixer.sh` | **Indentation** - modern tools (autopep8/black) | ✅ Tool fallbacks | `fix-indentation` |
+| `comprehensive-import-manager.sh` | **3-way imports** - absolute, missing, unused | ✅ Staged changes | `fix-imports` |
+| `sync-package-configs.sh` | **Config sync** - consistent Ruff/import rules | ✅ Preview mode | `sync-configs` |
+
+### 🎯 **Systematic 4-Step Process**
+1. **🚨 Pre-flight**: Fix syntax typos that block other tools
+2. **🔧 Indentation**: Apply consistent formatting  
+3. **📦 Imports**: Manage absolute imports for poly-repo
+4. **🐍 Modernization**: f-strings, typing, Python upgrades
+
+---
+
