+# 🛡️ Safety Mechanisms & Fallback Strategies
+
+## 📋 **Overview**
+All our development tools are built with **safety-first** principles, including multiple layers of protection, rollback mechanisms, and dry-run capabilities.
+
+---
+
+## 🔍 **Dry Run / Preview Modes**
+
+### 🎯 **How to Use Preview Mode**
+**ALL scripts support `--preview` mode** that shows what would be changed without making any modifications:
+
+```bash
+# Preview any script before running
+./dev-tools/scripts/systematic-code-fixer.sh packages/haive-prebuilt/src --preview
+./dev-tools/scripts/pre-flight-syntax-fixer.sh packages/haive-prebuilt/src --preview
+./dev-tools/scripts/modern-indentation-fixer.sh packages/haive-prebuilt/src --preview
+./dev-tools/scripts/comprehensive-import-manager.sh packages/haive-prebuilt/src --preview
+
+# Or use taskipy shortcuts
+poetry run task fix-code-preview
+poetry run task fix-syntax-preview
+poetry run task fix-indentation-preview
+poetry run task fix-imports-preview
+```
+
+### 📊 **What Preview Mode Shows**
+- **Detailed analysis** of issues found
+- **Exact changes** that would be applied
+- **File counts** and statistics
+- **Strategy explanation** for each tool
+- **No file modifications** - completely safe
+
+---
+
+## 🛡️ **Safety Checkpoints (Git Stash)**
+
+### 🔄 **Automatic Stashing**
+**Every script automatically creates git stash checkpoints** before making changes:
+
+```bash
+# Each script creates timestamped stashes
+SYSTEMATIC_FIXER_MASTER_20250729_182340
+PRE_FLIGHT_SYNTAX_20250729_183215
+INDENTATION_FIX_autopep8_20250729_183445
+IMPORT_MANAGER_CHECKPOINT_20250729_184012
+```
+
+### 🔙 **Rollback Instructions**
+**Every script provides rollback commands** in its output:
+
+```bash
+# Rollback to most recent checkpoint
+git stash apply stash@{0}
+
+# Rollback to specific checkpoint
+git stash list                    # See all checkpoints
+git stash apply stash@{1}         # Apply specific one
+
+# Nuclear rollback (restore master checkpoint)
+git stash apply stash@{N}         # Where N is the master checkpoint
+```
+
+### 📍 **Checkpoint Locations**
+| Script | Checkpoint Timing | Stash Message Pattern |
+|--------|------------------|----------------------|
+| `systematic-code-fixer.sh` | **Before any changes** | `SYSTEMATIC_FIXER_MASTER_*` |
+| `pre-flight-syntax-fixer.sh` | **Before syntax fixes** | `PRE_FLIGHT_SYNTAX_*` |
+| `modern-indentation-fixer.sh` | **Before indentation** | `INDENTATION_FIX_*` |
+| `comprehensive-import-manager.sh` | **Before import changes** | `IMPORT_MANAGER_CHECKPOINT_*` |
+| `sync-package-configs.sh` | **Before config sync** | `CONFIG_SYNC_CHECKPOINT_*` |
+
