+
+## 🚦 **Execution Modes & Conditions**
+
+### 🎯 **Step-by-Step Execution**
+```bash
+# Run individual steps safely
+poetry run task fix-code-step1    # Only syntax fixes
+poetry run task fix-code-step2    # Only indentation
+poetry run task fix-code-step3    # Only imports
