+### 🔄 **Conditional Workflows**
+| Condition | Action | Fallback |
+|-----------|--------|----------|
+| `syntax_errors > 10` | Skip indentation step | Show manual fix instructions |
+| `tool not found` | Skip tool-specific step | Use alternative tool |
+| `no changes detected` | Skip modification | Show "already clean" message |
+| `compilation fails` | Halt process | Provide rollback instructions |
