+# 🚀 Workflow Management with Taskipy
+
+## 🎯 **Why Taskipy?**
+- **Single Command**: `task fix-all` instead of running 5+ scripts
+- **Safety Built-in**: Automatic stashing before dangerous operations
+- **Composable**: Chain multiple operations together
+- **Discoverable**: `task --list` shows all available commands
+- **Cross-platform**: Works on Windows, Mac, Linux
+
+## 📋 **Available Task Categories**
+
+### 🚀 **Package-Level Operations**
+```bash
+task fix-games        # Complete 5-step fix for haive-games
+task fix-dataflow     # Complete 5-step fix for haive-dataflow  
+task fix-mcp          # Complete 5-step fix for haive-mcp
+task fix-agents       # Complete 5-step fix for haive-agents
+task fix-all          # Sequential fix of ALL packages
+```
+
+### 🎯 **Targeted Operations**
+```bash
+task eliminate-prints <directory>     # Remove print statements
+task modernize-syntax <directory>     # Pyupgrade modernization
+task format-code <directory>          # Ruff formatting
+task check-code <directory>           # Ruff linting
+task check-stats <directory>          # Error statistics
+```
+
+### 🔄 **Workflow Combinations**
+```bash
+task quick-fix <dir>       # prints + modernize + format
+task full-check <dir>      # Complete baseline assessment
+task clean-and-check <dir> # Fix then check results
+```
+
+### 🛡️ **Safety Operations**
+```bash
+task stash-save       # Create safety checkpoint
+task stash-list       # Show all checkpoints
+task stash-restore    # Rollback to last checkpoint
+```
+
+### 🚀 **Power Commands**
+```bash
+task nuclear-fix      # ULTIMATE: Stash + fix all packages + report
+task safe-experiment  # SAFE: Stash + quick fixes (easy rollback)
+task rollback         # UNDO: Restore from last stash
+```
+
+### 📋 **Development Workflow**
+```bash
+task dev-setup        # Install pre-commit hooks
+task dev-clean        # Remove __pycache__ and .pyc files
+task dev-lint         # Lint with auto-fix
+task dev-format       # Format all code
+task dev-all          # Complete dev environment setup
+```
+
+## 🎪 **Real-World Usage Examples**
+
+### **Scenario 1: Fix Messy Package**
+```bash
+# Current: haive-mcp has 1,589 errors (479 prints!)
+task check-stats packages/haive-mcp/src/     # Baseline: 1,589 errors
+task fix-mcp                                 # Complete fix
+task check-stats packages/haive-mcp/src/     # Result: ~200 errors
+```
+
+### **Scenario 2: Safe Experimentation**
+```bash
+task safe-experiment packages/haive-mcp/src/  # Stash + quick fixes
+# Test if you like the changes...
+task rollback                                 # Undo if not satisfied
+# OR
+git stash drop                               # Keep changes if satisfied
+```
+
+### **Scenario 3: Nuclear Option (Fix Everything)**
+```bash
+task nuclear-fix
+# Output:
+# 🚨 BEFORE: haive-games: 1,401 errors
+# 🚨 BEFORE: haive-dataflow: 3,138 errors  
+# 🚨 BEFORE: haive-mcp: 1,589 errors
+# ... (runs all fixes) ...
+# ✅ AFTER: haive-games: 400 errors
+# ✅ AFTER: haive-dataflow: 800 errors
+# ✅ AFTER: haive-mcp: 200 errors
+# 🎉 Total improvement: 80%+ across all packages!
+```
+
+### **Scenario 4: Daily Development**
+```bash
+task dev-setup     # One-time: install pre-commit
+# Then daily:
+task dev-all       # Clean + lint + format
+git add .
+git commit -m "..."  # Pre-commit hooks run automatically
+```
+
+## 🔧 **Advanced Task Composition**
+
+### **Chain Multiple Operations**
+```bash
+# Custom workflows by chaining tasks:
+task stash-save && task eliminate-prints src/ && task modernize-syntax src/ && task check-stats src/
+```
+
+### **Parallel Processing** 
+```bash
+# Fix multiple packages in parallel (advanced):
+task fix-games & task fix-dataflow & task fix-mcp & wait
+```
+
+### **Conditional Execution**
+```bash
+# Only proceed if first command succeeds:
+task check-stats src/ && task fix-package
+```
+
+## 📊 **Performance Benefits**
+
+### **Before Taskipy (Manual)**
+```bash
+cd packages/haive-mcp
+git stash push -m "checkpoint_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)"
+poetry run ruff check src/ --statistics
+poetry run autoflake --recursive --in-place --remove-all-unused-imports --remove-unused-variables src/
+poetry run autopep8 --aggressive --aggressive --in-place --recursive --max-line-length=88 src/
+poetry run docformatter --in-place --recursive src/
